---
// 六角形描邊標記（pointy-top）。用於 hero 浮水印與卡片縮圖。幾何取自設計原型。
interface Props {
  class?: string;
}
const { class: className } = Astro.props;
const HEX_OUTLINE =
  "M290.185 259.443l-141.093 83.296L8 259.443V92.639L149.092 9.343l141.093 83.296v166.804z";
---

<span class={"hex " + (className ?? "")} aria-hidden="true">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 298.185 352.082">
    <path
      fill="none"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="18"
      stroke-linejoin="round"
      d={HEX_OUTLINE}></path>
  </svg>
</span>
